== 2. LVDPLL (per-shire minion PLL) modes, 100 MHz reference (lvdpll_modes_config.h)
   45 entries, 300-1400 MHz in 25 MHz steps; mode 1 = 300 MHz at line 28

== 3. Boot modes (BL2 main.c noc_pll_mode/min_step_pll_mode; io_pll.c; mem_controller.c)
   NoC PLL2 (noc_pll_mode[0])                                 mode  37 ->   400.0 MHz (in 100)
   minion step clock PLL4 (min_step_pll_mode[0])              mode  34 ->   600.0 MHz (in 100)
   minion LVDPLL (min_lvdpll_mode[0], unused: step clock chosen) mode   1 ->   300.0 MHz (in 100)
   SP PLL0 (PLL0_100_PERCENT_TARGET_MODE)                     mode   3 ->  1000.0 MHz (in 100)
   SP PLL1 (PLL1_100_PERCENT_TARGET_MODE)                     mode   1 ->  2000.0 MHz (in 100)
   PShire PLL (PSHR_PLL_50_PERCENT_TARGET_MODE)               mode  54 ->   505.0 MHz (in 100)
   memshire PLL 933 (min_lvdpll_mode_933MHz[0])               mode  28 ->   933.0 MHz (in 100)
   memshire PLL 795                                           mode  50 ->   795.0 MHz (in 100)
   memshire PLL 1066                                          mode  19 ->  1066.0 MHz (in 100)

== 4. Hardware headroom below the tables (NOT reachable through any DM command)
   HPDPLL POSTDIV0 width 9 bits (max 511; mvls_tn7_hpdpll.ipxact.h:1198); DCO in tables 1066-4000 MHz
   LVDPLL POSTDIV0 width 8 bits (max 255; mvls_tn7_lvdpll.ipxact.h:1197); DCO in tables 1075-2100 MHz
   largest post-divider any table entry uses: HPDPLL 11, LVDPLL 4
   50 MHz via HPDPLL: post-divider 22-80 at the tables' DCO range; field max 511 -> fits
   50 MHz via LVDPLL: post-divider 22-42 at the tables' DCO range; field max 255 -> fits
   25 MHz via HPDPLL: post-divider 43-160 at the tables' DCO range; field max 511 -> fits
   25 MHz via LVDPLL: post-divider 43-84 at the tables' DCO range; field max 255 -> fits
   10 MHz via HPDPLL: post-divider 107-400 at the tables' DCO range; field max 511 -> fits
   10 MHz via LVDPLL: post-divider 108-210 at the tables' DCO range; field max 255 -> fits
   minimum output at the lowest table DCO and the widest divider: HPDPLL 2.09 MHz, LVDPLL 4.22 MHz

